    description: "The archived deposit of the toolkit, records and adapters"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-24"
license: MIT
license-url: "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vickybom/cn-piibench-lite"
abstract: >-
  An external, black-box audit toolkit that measures Chinese personal-information
  memorization and cross-lingual leakage in small and medium language models. It
  generates a checksum-valid synthetic corpus, builds a twelve-template probe
  matrix, submits the probes through interchangeable backends, and scores
  extraction by exact match with checksum re-validation, reporting a risk-weighted
  extraction rate and a matched-pair cross-lingual differential. The toolkit wraps
  the target model and never reads or modifies its weights.
keywords:
  - PII memorization
  - large language model privacy
  - Chinese PII
  - cross-lingual extraction
  - black-box auditing
  - differential privacy
  - benchmark
